    "title": "Face Beauty Makeup Camera",
    "description": "Face beauty camera makeup and face cleaner photo editor for photos helps to enhance the beauty of photos. Face beauty makeup camera is a professional face editing tool for all your beautiful photos. Get the natural look with this face photo cleaner app.\r\n\r\nGet perfect face and smooth skin to your photos with this face cleaner photo editor app. This photo face cleaner app acts as pimple remover, blemish remover and acne remover. It even removes the eye bags in your photos. All this happens just in one tap. Get flawless and natural skin in your photos with this photo cleaner app.\r\n\r\nSo forget about those blemishes, acne & pimple days and start using this photo face cleaner yourself. It also has\u00a0other face editing options for photos with lot of filters and frames to choose. Achieve best results with this face editing app for photos.\r\n\r\nBeauty makeup camera gives real-time makeup experience no matter how your photo looks. Give a makeover to all your photos with this beauty makeup plus camera app.Unleash the creativity in you by making your photos more beautiful with this face beauty camera app.\r\n\r\nWant to look gorgeous and fabulous?Try out our makeup camera plus beauty app at least once to get unique results. You will be amazed to see the before and after photos with this face editor beauty camera app. The face editing tool is super easy to use but turns out your photos into artistic way. So edit all your photos like a pro and get flawless smooth skin with this photo face cleaner app. It even removes the eye bags. You can try different colours on lips with this photo cleaner app. You can even adjust the brightness as well as the tone of the face with this face photo cleaner app.\r\n\r\nKey Features:\r\n\r\n1. This beauty editor free helps you to remove pimples, wrinkles and pigmentation for photos. It's a skin editor for photos.\r\n\r\n2. This beauty editor pro supports face foundation of different colours, in order to improve the skin tone and enhance its beauty for photos.\r\n\r\n3. Blemishes remover for photos includes tools like pimple remover and dark spot remover.\r\n\r\n4. Change eye color and brighten your eyes on photos. You can also remove dark circle and enlarge your eyes to enhance photo face beauty.\r\n\r\n5. Whitening face features for photos includes teeth whitening and skin whitening.\r\n\r\n6. Selfie camera functionality.\r\n\r\nOverall this face beauty camera app is an all in all makeover app for all your photos. Download this face cleaner photo editor app for free and share it with friends and family.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Face beauty camera makeup and face cleaner photo editor for photos helps to enhance the beauty of photos. Face beauty makeup camera is a professional face editing tool for all your beautiful photos. Get the natural look with this face photo cleaner app.<br><br>Get perfect face and smooth skin to your photos with this face cleaner photo editor app. This photo face cleaner app acts as pimple remover, blemish remover and acne remover. It even removes the eye bags in your photos. All this happens just in one tap. Get flawless and natural skin in your photos with this photo cleaner app.<br><br>So forget about those blemishes, acne &amp; pimple days and start using this photo face cleaner yourself. It also has\u00a0other face editing options for photos with lot of filters and frames to choose. Achieve best results with this face editing app for photos.<br><br>Beauty makeup camera gives real-time makeup experience no matter how your photo looks. Give a makeover to all your photos with this beauty makeup plus camera app.Unleash the creativity in you by making your photos more beautiful with this face beauty camera app.<br><br>Want to look gorgeous and fabulous?Try out our makeup camera plus beauty app at least once to get unique results. You will be amazed to see the before and after photos with this face editor beauty camera app. The face editing tool is super easy to use but turns out your photos into artistic way. So edit all your photos like a pro and get flawless smooth skin with this photo face cleaner app. It even removes the eye bags. You can try different colours on lips with this photo cleaner app. You can even adjust the brightness as well as the tone of the face with this face photo cleaner app.<br><br>Key Features:<br><br>1. This beauty editor free helps you to remove pimples, wrinkles and pigmentation for photos. It&#39;s a skin editor for photos.<br><br>2. This beauty editor pro supports face foundation of different colours, in order to improve the skin tone and enhance its beauty for photos.<br><br>3. Blemishes remover for photos includes tools like pimple remover and dark spot remover.<br><br>4. Change eye color and brighten your eyes on photos. You can also remove dark circle and enlarge your eyes to enhance photo face beauty.<br><br>5. Whitening face features for photos includes teeth whitening and skin whitening.<br><br>6. Selfie camera functionality.<br><br>Overall this face beauty camera app is an all in all makeover app for all your photos. Download this face cleaner photo editor app for free and share it with friends and family.",
